### Code Examples

```
.mask1 {
-webkit-mask-image: url(w3logo.png);
mask-image: 
  url(w3logo.png);
mask-repeat: no-repeat;
}

---

.mask1 {
-webkit-mask-image: url(w3logo.png);
mask-image: 
  url(w3logo.png);
}

---

.mask1 {
-webkit-mask-image: url(w3logo.png);
mask-image: 
  url(w3logo.png);
mask-repeat: no-repeat;
mask-position: 
  center;
}
